<title>NIGERIA: PZ Nigeria full year profits higher.</title>
<headline>PZ Nigeria full year profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year results for Nigerian conglomerate PZ Industries to end-May 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		   1995</p>
<p>Turnover		     13,980     vs	 8,070</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    2,050     vs	 1,270</p>
<p>Taxation			  675     vs	   477</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     1,380     vs	   796</p>
<p>Dividend per share	   30 kobo  vs	    20 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE - A scrip issue of one new share for every four is proposed after the proposed merger of the company with its subsidiary Thermocool Engineering Company in February 1997.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
